  "description": "Sub-workflow for Lark card buttons {action, id, token, operator, message_id}. Accepts a click only from the open_id in settings and with the row's current approval_token. Offer approve: plans the month once it has two approved offers and none proposed. Offer reject: proposes a replacement. Piece approve: runs 'Strategy: publish due'. Replies in Lark either way.",
